      "statement": "Only D1 (and KV and Queue) are shared reserved classes: the namespace key is fleet-wide precisely so a database outlives the name of any one Worker, so two scripts declaring d1_databases reach the same cells via one registry entry, while workflow classes carry their script and never share.",
