    {
      "id": "claim_6c8fcd3e8f874100b4cc20094b758b50",
      "statement": "Cron trigger expressions live in the deployment manifest (crons) rather than cell state: the reserved cron cell reads them from the manifest it runs under, so changing a schedule needs no migration of an already-armed alarm.",
