      "id": "claim_40e495bf8af744fe9c8bb263c3d0b87f",
      "statement": "Mixed-version rollouts are gated by capability feature strings (assets-v1, cron-v1, d1-v1, kv-v1, queues-v1, sqlite-vec-v1, r2-v1, wasm-v1, workflows-v1); a node lacking a feature refuses the deployment at deploy time, so mixed fleets fail before requests rather than during them.",
